### PageConfig API Test File

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@pageId = test-page

### 1. Retrieve Current Config (Cache first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pageconfig?id={{pageId}}

### 2. Add Field
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pageconfig/{{pageId}}/fields
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "range_code": "list",
    "field": {
        "label": "New Field",
        "field": "new_field",
        "type": "input"
    }
}

### 3. Edit Field
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/pageconfig/{{pageId}}/fields
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "range_code": "list",
    "field": {
        "label": "Updated Field",
        "field": "new_field",
        "type": "input",
        "props": { "placeholder": "Updated" }
    }
}

### 4. Delete Field
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pageconfig/{{pageId}}/fields/delete
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "range_code": "list",
    "field_name": "new_field"
}

### 5. Sync Redis to MongoDB
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pageconfig/{{pageId}}/toconfig
